<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia May palm oil export duties.</title>
<headline>Malaysia May palm oil export duties.</headline>
<text>
<p>(All quoted in ringgit/tonne)</p>
<p>Products		     Value		   Duty</p>
<p>				May	(April)     May    (April)</p>
<p>Crude Palm Oil	    1,325.00 (1,426.83)  177.50 (208.05)</p>
<p>Processed Palm Oil	1,425.01 (1,433.50)  207.50 (210.05)</p>
<p>Palm Kernel Oil	   1,003.84 (1,063.11)  200.77 (212.63)</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-7510)</p>
